# VoiceBot Studio

Tagline: Build smart voice bots without the headache.

A simple way to create phone menus and AI voice helpers.

Setting up a phone menu used to be a nightmare. With VoiceBot Studio, you just draw a simple flowchart—like "Press 1 for Sales." You can even add an AI brain that talks to your customers naturally. It's like having a professional call center that you can manage right from your browser.

Key features:
- Visual Builder: Drag and drop blocks. No coding required.
- AI Speech: Text-to-Speech in 50 languages. Global support.
- Call Recording: Record calls for quality. Compliance & Training.
- Analytics: See where callers drop off. Optimize flows.

Benefits:
- Lower support costs
- 24/7 availability
- Professional image
- Easy updates

FAQs:

Q: Do they sound robotic?
A: No, we use Neural AI voices that sound very human, with natural intonation and pacing.

Q: What languages are supported?
A: We support over 50 languages and 100+ different localized accents.

Q: Can it transfer to my mobile?
A: Yes, the bot can transfer a call to any phone number globally if it cannot solve the problem.

Q: Does it work with my CRM?
A: Yes, we provide webhooks and a native Zapier integration to move data to 5,000+ apps.

Q: Can I listen to calls?
A: Yes, all calls are recorded and transcribed for quality assurance and training.

Q: Do I need coding skills?
A: No, our "Studio" is a 100% visual, drag-and-drop platform.

Q: Do I need a new phone system?
A: No, we work in the cloud. You keep your existing handsets or use our softphone interface.

Q: How well does it understand speech?
A: Our ASR (Automatic Speech Recognition) is powered by Google Cloud, reaching 95%+ accuracy even with background noise.

Q: What does the "Visual Builder" capability include?
A: Drag and drop blocks. The benefit: no coding required.

Q: What does the "AI Speech" capability include?
A: Text-to-Speech in 50 languages. The benefit: global support.